{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"一、九年。春，宋火。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"曷為或言災？或言火？大者曰災，小者曰火。然則內何以不言火？內不言火者，甚之也。何以書？記災也。外災不書，此何以書？為王者之後記災也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"二、夏，季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"三、五月辛酉，夫人姜氏薨。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"四、秋八月癸未，葬我小君繆姜。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"五、冬，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子、齊世子光伐鄭。十有二月己亥，同盟于戲。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_159_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_159","textTraditional":"六、楚子伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}